$ pda help restore
$ pda restore --help
Restore key/value pairs from an NDJSON dump

Usage:
  pda restore [DB] [flags]

Aliases:
  restore, import

Flags:
  -f, --file string   Path to an NDJSON dump (defaults to stdin)
  -h, --help          help for restore
